    {"q":"Spot the error: He made me (A) / to wait (B) / for two hours. (C) / No error (D)","o":["He made me","to wait","for two hours","No error"],"a":1,"e":"Active voice में 'make' के बाद bare infinitive — 'made me wait'।"},
    {"q":"Spot the error: She finished (A) / to write (B) / the letter before dinner. (C) / No error (D)","o":["She finished","to write","the letter before dinner","No error"],"a":1,"e":"'finish' के बाद gerund — 'finished writing the letter'।"},
    {"q":"Spot the error: I have (A) / just finished (B) / my homework. (C) / No error (D)","o":["I have","just finished","my homework","No error"],"a":3,"e":"'just' के साथ present perfect (have + V3) सही प्रयोग है — कोई त्रुटि नहीं।"},
    {"q":"Spot the error: This sweet (A) / is tasting (B) / very good. (C) / No error (D)","o":["This sweet","is tasting","very good","No error"],"a":1,"e":"'taste' (स्वाद होना) stative अर्थ में continuous नहीं लेता — 'tastes very good'।"},
    {"q":"Spot the error: He enjoys (A) / to play cricket (B) / in the evening. (C) / No error (D)","o":["He enjoys","to play cricket","in the evening","No error"],"a":1,"e":"'enjoy' के बाद gerund — 'enjoys playing cricket'।"},
    {"q":"Choose the correct sentence.","o":["He suggested me to go home.","He did not went home.","He had better to go home.","He insisted on going home."],"a":3,"e":"'insist on + gerund' सही; suggest के बाद 'me to' नहीं, did के बाद V1, had better के बाद bare infinitive।"},
    {"q":"Choose the correct sentence.","o":["She is resembling her mother.","She resembles her mother.","She resembles to her mother.","She is resembled her mother."],"a":1,"e":"'resemble' stative और transitive है — 'resembles her mother' (बिना 'to', बिना -ing)।"}
